OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACall for employment support for
OL,4,Apeople with sight loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government taskforce needs to be
OL,7,Fcreated to help blind and partially
OL,8,Fsighted people access work, a report
OL,9,Fhas concluded.
OL,11,FAccording to the Out of Sight ` Out of
OL,12,FWork report, 73% of blind and partially
OL,13,Fsighted people of working age in the UK
OL,14,Fare not in employment compared to 17%
OL,15,Fof the non-disabled population.
OL,17,FReport author Lord Holmes of Richmond,
OL,18,Fwho went blind in childhood, said: "The
OL,19,Fmost important thing we need from
OL,20,Fgovernment is clear leadership and a
OL,21,Fcommitment to establish a taskforce."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
