OL,3,GNEWSACall for employment support for
OL,4,Apeople with sight loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Work and Pensions
OL,7,F(DWP) has said it wants every visually
OL,8,Fimpaired person who can work to have
OL,9,Fthe support they need.
